{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>42歲前港姐袁嘉敏昨日前往內地進行登台表演，以一身極致性感的打扮亮相舞台，瞬間引爆全場氣氛。正當觀眾沉醉於強勁 …</p><p></p>\n<p>42歲前港姐袁嘉敏昨日前往內地進行登台表演，以一身極致性感的打扮亮相舞台，瞬間引爆全場氣氛。正當觀眾沉醉於強勁節拍之際，她身上那件超低胸戰衣卻突然出現驚險狀況。這場本應普通的商業演出最後演變成一場極具視覺衝擊力的意外場面。</p>\n<h2>袁嘉敏登台火辣扭動引發全場暴動</h2>\n<p>袁嘉敏當晚挑選了一襲極度貼身且布料極少的紅色亮片吊帶短裙登陸內地舞台，將豐滿上圍及S形曲線表露無遺。在強烈燈光照射下，她伴隨著激昂音樂不斷擺出嫵媚姿勢，更頻頻向台下觀眾展示誘人身段。正當氣氛高漲時，她肩上的吊帶竟輪流滑落至手臂位置，形成欲落還留極度危險畫面，台下尖叫聲瞬間響徹整個表演場地。</p>\n<h2>舞台險走光展現強大心理質素應對</h2>\n<p>面對隨時徹底走光的極高風險，這位經驗豐富的女星表現得十分鎮定，完全沒有慌亂遮掩。她一邊若無其事地繼續深情獻唱，一邊對著瘋狂觀眾甜笑，表現得極度風騷，順勢將這場危機化作表演一部分。完成台上大膽演出後，她回到後台隨即展現親和一面，主動為大批守候多時粉絲簽名及合影，更在宣傳板前瘋狂向眾人送上飛吻。</p>\n<h2>轉戰網絡開設專屬付費頻道吸金</h2>\n<p>近年逐漸淡出傳統影圈，主力轉戰成為網絡意見領袖，並開始頻頻接下東南亞及內地各地商演工作。她一直毫不吝嗇向外界展露自己傲人天賦，更食住個勢自行開設會員制專屬平台，以極度私密及獨家內容作為賣點，成功號召大量死忠粉絲付費訂閱。憑藉這些破格舉動加上密密接下各類型登台騷，吸金力變得極其強勁。</p>\n<h2>Candy惹火片段流出激起網上熱話</h2>\n<p>當晚現場火辣演出片段迅速在網上瘋傳，大批網民對其極致誘惑台風議論紛紛。有看過影片的網民留言表示「這身材保養得太誇張了」，亦有人認為她故意讓吊帶滑落的做法極度高招，直指「完全掌握到舞台氣氛密碼」。連串討論直接推高了影片點擊率，隨後更有大量內地主辦方急不及待向她招手，商演邀約數字持續攀升。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179557516724739814_7540916456b064d7fc0e9e.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"袁嘉敏 走光 （圖片來源：小紅書）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179557516724739814_7540916456b064d7fc0e9e.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179557516867776784_3626949736b064d810de37.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"袁嘉敏 走光 （圖片來源：小紅書）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179557516867776784_3626949736b064d810de37.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179557516985673916_2024855136b064d8247b47.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"袁嘉敏 走光 （圖片來源：IG@candy_kamanyuen）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179557516985673916_2024855136b064d8247b47.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@candy_kamanyuen）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179557517078961923_2595318356b064d832af69.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"袁嘉敏 走光 （圖片來源：小紅書）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179557517078961923_2595318356b064d832af69.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179557517361670308_20629404636b064d861507a.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"袁嘉敏 走光 （圖片來源：小紅書）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179557517361670308_20629404636b064d861507a.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179557517514575077_3164634936b064d8783ec7.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"袁嘉敏 走光 （圖片來源：小紅書）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179557517514575077_3164634936b064d8783ec7.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179557517645950790_11192755506b064d88d08f7.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"袁嘉敏 走光 （圖片來源：小紅書）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179557517645950790_11192755506b064d88d08f7.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179557517773979645_12714956826b064d8a34f52.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"袁嘉敏 走光 （圖片來源：小紅書）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179557517773979645_12714956826b064d8a34f52.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179415197077128707_5667610996af0962325dc7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"袁嘉敏 走光 大曬性感身材！（圖片來源：IG@candy_kamanyuen）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179415197077128707_5667610996af0962325dc7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>大曬性感身材！（圖片來源：IG@candy_kamanyuen）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179251214815529822_17268361606ad7909442ad5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"袁嘉敏 走光 袁嘉敏一身極少布料現身酒店露台（圖片來源：IG@candy_kamanyuen）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179251214815529822_17268361606ad7909442ad5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>袁嘉敏一身極少布料現身酒店露台（圖片來源：IG@candy_kamanyuen）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%85%a7%e5%9c%b0%e7%99%bb%e5%8f%b0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">內地登台</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%a2%81%e5%98%89%e6%95%8f/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">袁嘉敏</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%b5%b0%e5%85%89/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">走光</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：小紅書、IG@candy_kamanyuen資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3549634\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 25 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T04:23:52.896786+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1328,"images":10,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T02:53:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T04:17:18.986734+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T04:17:18.986734+00:00","content_hash":"4e9165a5cd49bb89fd587a0d03a2db4bccbaf6d9b55bf6d4b4dfd91b060f40a0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}